{"id": "60260", "title": "密丛深处有磨菇", "author": "青衣滂滂", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 13, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/60/60260.htm", "intro": "属性分类：现代/都市生活/年上攻/甜蜜 \r\n关键字：配角 其他 \r\n\r\n叶知凡：名字...就叫叶清礼吧，清雅守礼。 \r\n\r\n男孩：我，我觉得叫叶知礼更好...一些 \r\n\r\n叶知凡：如果你喜欢的话，也行。 \r\n不过...我希望你能明白， \r\n我们的关系并不需要养父养子或兄弟之间所谓血缘的称呼来维系， \r\n你要相信我绝不会离开你。 \r\n\r\n男孩：...嗯！ \r\n\r\n一贯温馨，养成恋童，中后期有肉~ \r\n潜在雷点：两人的初H很早很早...", "base": "files/article/html/60/60260", "chapters": [{"title": "1-5", "file": "8833972.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6-10", "file": "8833977.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-16", "file": "8833979.html", "available": false}, {"title": "17-21", "file": "8833984.html", "available": false}, {"title": "22-26", "file": "8833986.html", "available": false}, {"title": "27-31", "file": "8833990.html", "available": false}, {"title": "32-36", "file": "8833992.html", "available": false}, {"title": "37-41", "file": "8833993.html", "available": false}, {"title": "42-46", "file": "8833995.html", "available": false}, {"title": "47-51", "file": "8833996.html", "available": false}, {"title": "52-56", "file": "8833997.html", "available": false}, {"title": "57-60", "file": "8833998.html", "available": false}, {"title": "番外", "file": "8834000.html", "available": false}]}